            "body": "Superseded by #30212, which consolidates the JIT kernel tests that actually compile and pass on ROCm (test_rmsnorm, test_rope, test_dsv32_indexer_fusion). CI showed the other kernels in this batch are CUDA-only at the source level (missing cuda_fp16.h/cuda_bf16.h/cuda_runtime.h/cub/cooperative_groups headers, nv_bfloat16 types), so they can't be registered for AMD until the kernels are ported to HIP.",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-06T19:21:58Z",
